{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:30 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"姚兵自揭生活艱難零家用 曾靠老婆貼錢追夢感謝不離不棄 因一舉動得罪主持痛失機會\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/247f993339bf6171093eda80b08cf612/2026-11/KF_55.jpg\"/>\n<p>TVB節目《中年好聲音4》的「白羊君」姚兵，近日接受YouTube頻道《橙色大笨象 Orange Elephant》訪問，大談追逐演藝夢的艱辛，姚兵更提到太太從拍拖到結婚，多年來不離不棄支持他追夢，甚至花儲蓄及補貼姚兵，成為其經濟支柱。</p>\n<h2>姚兵獲太太支持追夢</h2>\n<p>姚兵在訪問中，提到自己已婚：「呢幾年我係好多謝、好多謝我太太。其實我想講俾所有男人聽嘅一件事，呢個就係，做一個乖男人呢，其實千祈唔好太多出面嘅迎合（應酬）呢樣嘢。」姚兵自爆有一段時間，由於生活艱難，不但沒有給予家用，更要太太作為經濟支柱：「其實呢幾年係搵唔到咩錢㗎啦。老婆係一路幫我儲、支持呢啲錢係儲返落嚟。其實呢幾年我係，我（俾）屋企一毫子都無拎返去。佢都係每個月，俾錢我使，呢個就係最好嘅支持啦！」姚兵稱自己好實際，不會只用言語感謝太太：「呢啲嘢全部都係好虛華（浮誇）嘅呢啲嘢嚟㗎。但係依家呢個係最實際嘅，同埋依家都係一路支持緊我。」</p>\n<img alt=\"姚兵於TVB默默耕耘多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f44f292f8073012aa736237ef850f42a/2026-02/z76.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵於2018年簽約TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd3c640eec35811fbbdedaceee37559e/2026-02/z2_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵於2013年曾參加《星夢傳奇》並奪得殿軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d09fb9d37c97453ff9b3fe1a2051bf1/2026-02/z5_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾跟鄭世豪一起參加《星夢傳奇》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/344d596852ee73554864702b019f8a76/2026-02/3334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民估白羊君的真身是TVB老臣子姚兵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56f551af97ed04aedf40938e25e2b7d4/2026-02/z1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵近日接受YouTube頻道《橙色大笨象 Orange Elephant》訪問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0fe55a4eeba124ca4b2d0f5719fe4265/2026-11/Yiu_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵稱經被歌唱學校走數。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5107f7b2c611a946dc67e48b11d78677/2026-11/Yiu_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵感謝太太支持追夢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61370a8cf427742b23ff5cd6654962ba/2026-11/Yiu_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾有一段時間生活艱難，要靠太太養家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23ff6d07cc6435cd15dd29330d55d465/2026-11/Yiu_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵自爆有一段時間沒有畀家用。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75b6127344ae2459cf228659325d89e8/2026-11/Yiu_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵坦言要太太給予自己生活費。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f7a534636c68a9a8b7f23361659b86a/2026-11/Yiu_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾在內地發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2283115afd1527afa765f33bc3c96585/2026-11/Yiu_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵來港發展多年，卻一直沒有機會唱歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac3c109f4118616025dad5719ce5c8e9/2026-11/Yiu_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵想向音樂界發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97e52303d7d2e167c7642fbd1553f77d/2026-11/Yiu_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾經到寧波參加歌唱比賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa18042686d6e02ed4509859497dcbaf/2026-11/Yiu_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵因為不滿主持拍頭，而錯失機會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20e5112116bf8cccf0a8a9131435b9a4/2026-11/Yiu_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵因為失言，而學懂收歛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e5ca5dd387d8ff056f9bc025e63da53/2026-11/Yiu_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾於2019年上《流行經典50年》演唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc9d49c3d1f92d6d15a9d52a9f45dee8/2026-02/z4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾演出《多功能老婆》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1414a4897c32ab537618762e5d3251b/2026-02/z3_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵參加《中年好聲音4》，獲得第17名。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/935cac790a9fbb2ed0614f4948199e3d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_14_26_45.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民估白羊君的真身是TVB老臣子姚兵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4f46e3e54fc9597a634f1b3ceca190e2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_14_26_45_7_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>姚兵學唱歌被學校走數</h2>\n<p>姚兵早在17、18歲時已涉足社會，卻因從小熱愛唱歌，想提升歌藝而受騙：「係我兩年嘅人工就全部俾晒呢個學校，咁跟住落嚟呢個學校就突然之間搬咗，其實係呃人嘅。嗰時我哋通信都唔係好、好發達啦，全部都係睇報紙㗎嘛。打小廣告，就係。我就睇咗呢個廣告：『啊，北京呢啲學校』﹛嗰時已經係知自己識唱歌㗎啦。我就是想搵一個地方提升、提升下一自己嘅呢啲唱歌水平。嗰個打擊係好大嘅，20歲都未到，好似人人、人生就……就謝咗，成個人就謝咗啦。」</p>\n<h2>姚兵曾年少輕狂得罪人</h2>\n<p>姚兵後來到寧波電視台參加歌唱比賽，在當地漸漸建立起名氣，卻因年少輕狂，不懂收斂情緒，而得罪節目主持。當時有位主持在台下拍打姚兵的頭，讚賞他唱得不錯。姚兵卻面露不悅：「我啱啱就做好頭、頭髮嘛，我有髮型㗎嘛，佢咁樣做，就整到我好烏糟邋遢。咁我就話：『我說，你幹嘛呀？你這個手腳能不能稍微這個乾淨一點？』」卻因此得罪對方，而失去亮相機會。經一事長一智，姚兵學懂收歛，不能輕易表露負面情緒，否則會因一個失控的舉動，摧毀之前累積的心血。</p>\n<img alt=\"姚兵曾以蒙面身份「白羊君」參加《中年好聲音4》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/246b88a0915098dfac8581b9d1680712/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509242_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君演唱〈趁早〉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e4082139c5cfefdff4ce483fc6cb666/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509242_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君表現穩健。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bd29164f838a956831e338cc094e4c8/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509243_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"肥媽好快就撳燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2cf9e32d2be5868ea8e2c5a1a37bfe7b/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509243_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君不斷展現雄渾震音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1c485cd9b3b2acba677b3b0646d5ba6/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509243_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君挑戰難度極高的〈趁早〉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/492014615725f7e9d55997721f38f56a/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509243_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"〈趁早〉即使難唱，但未能考起白羊君。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc521f972ad52faadf0c886226f9c7a6/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509244_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君台風不俗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/688c99fae232ffff29fed15bc599d80a/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509244_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君唱得好放。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bf79215d054091ec5304ba84532231b/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509244_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"最終張佳添都為白羊君按燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74a9ce23845717c9424279c35de704cd/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509245_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君宣佈直接晉級。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42cd122dc75323cb73a9324e12dcb899/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509245_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"車婉婉對談白羊君。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8956d4bd0143aa7da4302e3b3f50b826/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509245_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君指揀〈趁早〉是希望趁早晉級。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25ff89d1e2a6be6697de571c0f158425/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509245_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"白羊君演唱實力獲肯定。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb9ffbb3f04aa903a29ed56be2ed398/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509245_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添指白羊君震音已成習慣，會阻礙表現感情，但白羊君卻越唱越好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/583c9ff9be4c23f1e4fdf13226d708c8/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509245_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"海兒指〈趁早〉好難唱，白羊君表現值得畀燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fa67ffb72f785f664389e1062ecb84c/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509246_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"周國豐指白羊君能夠表現出歌曲的男性味道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/028f5ee1e81e012b797137a5b7714a4a/2026-02/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29509246_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵改善廣東話咬字問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06a7569879e3c62aeeb0969bb7f404cd/2026-03/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29539448_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵深情演繹〈誰明浪子心〉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc166850ce8f03bdf4a722058edeb2c1/2026-03/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29539504_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵在台上自認瀟灑，引起全場爆笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/528fa2949a45fc678938df023f02f335/2026-03/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29539503_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵的廣東話咬字有瑕疵，但經過指導後大有改善。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/939eee0c58aca16206bad2e28d1b1494/2026-03/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29539501_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚兵表現理想。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f07504d35e7b80ee16c404053a3c917a/2026-03/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29539501_03_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.501188+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":871,"images":44,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:30:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T15:17:29.194488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:25.847148+00:00","content_hash":"61b55209486b578107ddf9b99262cf18ab25ed658d2aeb5f6d2d80aef03a5a64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}